---
source: src/views/welcome.rs
expression: "page(\"Asgard\", &display_name::form(\"/welcome/name\", \"Ondra\", None),\n\"/welcome/done\").into_string().replace(\"><\", \">\\n<\")"
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Welcome | Asgard</title>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#3E5B2B" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#263820" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Asgard">
<link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/static/icon.[hash].svg">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/static/apple-touch-icon.[hash].png">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/app.[hash].css">
<meta name="htmx-config" content="{&quot;responseHandling&quot;:[{&quot;code&quot;:&quot;204&quot;,&quot;swap&quot;:false},{&quot;code&quot;:&quot;[23]..&quot;,&quot;swap&quot;:true},{&quot;code&quot;:&quot;422&quot;,&quot;swap&quot;:true},{&quot;code&quot;:&quot;[45]..&quot;,&quot;swap&quot;:false,&quot;error&quot;:true},{&quot;code&quot;:&quot;...&quot;,&quot;swap&quot;:false}]}">
<script src="/static/htmx-2.0.11.min.[hash].js" defer>
</script>
<script type="module" src="/static/register-sw.[hash].js">
</script>
</head>
<body>
<main class="standalone">
<picture class="hero">
<source srcset="/static/logo-hero-dark.[hash].svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
<img src="/static/logo-hero-light.[hash].svg" alt="" width="180" height="180">
</picture>
<h1>Welcome to Asgard</h1>
<p class="lead">You're in the Crew. Here's what to know before you start.</p>
<section class="welcome-section" aria-labelledby="welcome-name">
<h2 id="welcome-name">Your name</h2>
<p>The Admin typed it in for you. Fix it here if they got it wrong.</p>
<form class="name-form" method="post" action="/welcome/name" hx-post="/welcome/name" hx-swap="outerHTML">
<label for="display-name">Display name</label>
<div class="field-row">
<input id="display-name" type="text" name="display_name" value="Ondra" required autocomplete="nickname" aria-describedby="display-name-note">
<button class="button" type="submit">Save</button>
</div>
<p class="note" id="display-name-note" role="status">This is how the Crew sees you.</p>
</form>
</section>
<section class="welcome-section" aria-labelledby="welcome-install">
<h2 id="welcome-install">Put Asgard on your home screen</h2>
<p>It then opens like an app, without the browser around it.</p>
<dl class="install">
<dt>iPhone</dt>
<dd>In Safari, tap <strong>Share</strong>, then <strong>Add to Home Screen</strong>. An iPhone only delivers Asgard's notifications once it's on the Home Screen.</dd>
<dt>Android</dt>
<dd>In Chrome, tap the <strong>⋮</strong> menu, then <strong>Install app</strong> or <strong>Add to Home screen</strong>.</dd>
</dl>
</section>
<section class="welcome-section" aria-labelledby="welcome-push">
<h2 id="welcome-push">Notifications</h2>
<div class="placeholder" id="push-control">Turning on notifications for this device is coming soon.</div>
</section>
<section class="welcome-section" aria-labelledby="welcome-tour">
<h2 id="welcome-tour">Where things are</h2>
<dl class="tour">
<dt>Finance</dt>
<dd>Log what you spent for the Crew and see who owes whom.</dd>
<dt>Shopping</dt>
<dd>The list of things the Crew needs to buy, by how soon.</dd>
<dt>Reminders</dt>
<dd>Notify the whole Crew at a set date and time.</dd>
<dt>Quotes</dt>
<dd>The Crew's collection of memorable things people said.</dd>
</dl>
</section>
<form method="post" action="/welcome/done">
<button class="button" type="submit">Got it</button>
</form>
</main>
</body>
</html>
